<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 18.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 18.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Tuesday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for June 18. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   17.06.97	  16.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5412	    6.5468</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3065	    2.3046</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5126	    4.4990</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5297	    3.5029</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5137	    0.5146</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7682	    0.7675</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2883	    0.2881</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0096	    7.0028</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6942	    0.6947</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2337	    1.2333</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
